  "version": "2.1",
  "description": "v2.1: Reskins the Orbital Exchange Interface into a laptop, makes it craftable for FREE (no tech unlock needed) with the original recipe cost, renames it to 'UDA Terminal Laptop' with a laptop icon, and lets you place it indoors and on benches/tables. The bundled UDA_Terminal_Laptop_P.pak swaps the deployed mesh to the ICA hab laptop (SM_ORB_PRP_Laptop_01). This EXMOD: free Crafting Bench / Fabricator / Manufacturer recipe (Steel Ingot 5, Electronics 5, Glass 3, Epoxy 2), laptop placement ghost, surface-friendly placement, and the rename/icon. The exchange function is the game's own and is untouched. No deer trophy. Requires both files - both ship in this EXMODZ.",
